name easyformat
category Package
revision 44543
shortdesc Easily add boldface, italics and smallcaps
relocated 1
longdesc This package allows the use of underscores and circumflexes to
longdesc begin resp. end italic, bold or SMALLCAPS formatting, as an
longdesc alternative to the standard LaTeX \textit{...}, \textbf{...}
longdesc and/or \textsc{...}. The meaning of underscore and circumflex
longdesc in mathmode remain the same.
runfiles size=2
 RELOC/tex/latex/easyformat/easyformat.sty
